flowchart LR
    K8s[K8s pod - SA JWT] --> V[Vault / Secrets Manager]
    CI[CI job - OIDC] --> V
    Dev[Developer - SSO] --> V
    V -->|short-lived lease| DBC[Dynamic DB credentials TTL 1h]
    V -->|versioned KV| API[API keys]
    V -->|PKI| TLS[Short-lived certs]
    V --> AUD[(Audit log)]
    V -.->|lease expiry| REVOKE[Auto-revoke]
